{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_06",
  "title": "邂逅",
  "storyCode": "RI-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa58f1c291f119841904e00ac9a4857887ec42bcc4d1f689595d12bdfab924e8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怎麼只有你們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "text": "巨木部族的人不見了，我聽說好像他們的首領被一個外來者打敗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "text": "火石部族還有粗尾部族被一個不知道哪裡來的背著很多武器的傢伙給全打趴下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "text": "還有幾個部族選擇了加入祖瑪瑪的部族。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "text": "老實說，祖瑪瑪搞出來的陣仗真厲害，要不是我是嘉維爾的追隨者，說不定也要去加入祖瑪瑪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......沒關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有你們幾個部族的人也足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "text": "喂，我們真的能戰勝祖瑪瑪嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘉維爾一定能夠戰勝祖瑪瑪的巨大機器，到時候，就由我來成為大酋長，讓嘉維爾留下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "text": "佩塔覺得，這樣不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": ".......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是，這是唯一能讓嘉維爾留下來的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不要忘了，我們是為了什麼才成立的“嘉維爾意志”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“嘉維爾意志”不只是一個部族，是我們所有希望嘉維爾成為大酋長的人的聯盟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長B",
      "text": "我支持特米米，我只認嘉維爾做大酋長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長A",
      "text": "沒錯，嘉維爾才是應該領導我們的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族長C",
      "text": "嘿，要是我不同意，我就不會站在這裡了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "text": "......佩塔不喜歡，但是佩塔會做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那麼你們到了祖瑪瑪部族外面等我來找你們，明白了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族長",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那麼，一切都是為了嘉維爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族長",
      "text": "一切都是為了嘉維爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "博士，還有其他人也在！太好了，終於找到你們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "唉，博士，你可把我擔心壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嗯？煌，你怎麼就把泳裝穿——你的背上怎麼還有個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "這小姑娘是我剛才走在路上遇到的，也不知道怎麼回事見面就打我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "那我肯定打回去啊，就把她和她手下全給打趴下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不得不說這小姑娘身手還不錯，也挺抗打，我就帶上了，想著找到你之後讓你幫我問問為什麼要打我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，克瑪爾的話，我覺得她大概就是單純看你挺厲害，就想跟你打一架，這傢伙可是個戰鬥狂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈，能被你這麼評價的傢伙還真是稀奇啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "我又不是戰鬥狂，我只是習慣用比較直接的方法解決問題而已啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "行行行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "text": "......這裡是......哪裡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "你醒了，克瑪爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "text": "嘉維爾？！你怎麼在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "你遇到了我的同伴，對她出手然後被她打倒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嘿，你終於醒了，小姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "喂，嘉維爾，她幹什麼，怎麼剛醒就忽然向我彎腰了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "克瑪爾，你要幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "text": "我在她身上感受到了連我在祖瑪瑪身上都沒感受過的更純粹的強大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "text": "嘉維爾，我對你失去興趣了。你好像能和她交流，幫我告訴她，請指導我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，她說讓你教她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啥？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "大概意思就是覺得你太強了，想做你小弟，這樣的感覺吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......博士，怎麼辦啊，我從沒遇到過這種事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這要由你來決定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不關我事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "呃，要不讓她先跟著我們？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "也行，喂，克瑪爾，你先跟著我們好了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "燧石",
          "text": "好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "燧石",
          "text": "不過，現在，叫我燧石。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "說起來，祭典怎麼樣了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "博士，你來給煌講解一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "不惜讓手下感染礦石病也要造機器？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嘿，這我可不能坐視不管。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "那還等什麼，博士，繼續前進吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "不過，我們還有另一個地方要去！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
